error[E0308]: cannot assign to module variable `count` in a function: only top-level code sets module variables, and they are frozen once the module has initialized. Use host memory (`SPEC.md` §7) for state that changes between calls.
  --> 3:3
   |
  3|   count = count + 1
   |   ^^^^^
